          "title": "访问 0x0A = 00001 01 0",
          "desc": "`0x0A` = 10 = `00001010`。分解：Tag=`00001`(1), 行号=`01`(1), 块内=`0`。查 Line 1：Valid=0 → 缺失"
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            { "r": 0, "c": 0, "val": "1" }, { "r": 0, "c": 1, "val": "10" }, { "r": 0, "c": 2, "val": "0" }, { "r": 0, "c": 3, "val": "M[40]" },
